{"source":"github","project_id":"vetiver-posit-co","target":"rstudio/vetiver.posit.co","id":"pr/27","ref":27,"title":"Add little dataset of :sparkles: new :sparkles: cars for monitoring","description":"This PR adds a new little simulated dataset of cars for us to use in the monitoring section.\r\n\r\n``` r\r\nnew_cars \u003c- readr::read_csv(\"get-started/new-cars.csv\")\r\n#\u003e Rows: 50 Columns: 12\r\n#\u003e ── Column specification ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n#\u003e Delimiter: \",\"\r\n#\u003e dbl  (11): mpg, cyl, disp, hp, drat, wt, qsec, vs, am, gear, carb\r\n#\u003e date  (1): date_obs\r\n#\u003e \r\n#\u003e ℹ Use `spec()` to retrieve the full column specification for this data.\r\n#\u003e ℹ Specify the column types or set `show_col_types = FALSE` to quiet this message.\r\nskimr::skim(new_cars)\r\n```\r\n\r\n|                                                  |          |\r\n|:-------------------------------------------------|:---------|\r\n| Name                                             | new_cars |\r\n| Number of rows                                   | 50       |\r\n| Number of columns                                | 12       |\r\n| \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_   |          |\r\n| Column type frequency:                           |          |\r\n| Date                                             | 1        |\r\n| numeric                                          | 11       |\r\n| \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_\\_ |          |\r\n| Group variables                                  | None     |\r\n\r\nData summary\r\n\r\n**Variable type: Date**\r\n\r\n| skim_variable | n_missing | complete_rate | min        | max        | median     | n_unique |\r\n|:--------------|----------:|--------------:|:-----------|:-----------|:-----------|---------:|\r\n| date_obs      |         0 |             1 | 2022-03-15 | 2022-05-03 | 2022-04-08 |       50 |\r\n\r\n**Variable type: numeric**\r\n\r\n| skim_variable | n_missing | complete_rate |   mean |     sd |     p0 |    p25 |    p50 |    p75 |   p100 | hist  |\r\n|:--------------|----------:|--------------:|-------:|-------:|-------:|-------:|-------:|-------:|-------:|:------|\r\n| mpg           |         0 |             1 |  19.48 |   5.77 |   7.74 |  15.43 |  19.51 |  23.78 |  30.57 | ▂▅▇▅▃ |\r\n| cyl           |         0 |             1 |   6.35 |   1.66 |   2.41 |   5.01 |   6.36 |   7.55 |   9.23 | ▂▇▇▇▇ |\r\n| disp          |         0 |             1 | 224.04 | 114.17 | -25.40 | 139.46 | 238.89 | 298.64 | 471.32 | ▂▅▇▆▂ |\r\n| hp            |         0 |             1 | 149.65 |  64.08 |  -3.67 |  98.94 | 147.13 | 192.35 | 282.00 | ▂▆▇▆▃ |\r\n| drat          |         0 |             1 |   3.55 |   0.47 |   2.55 |   3.19 |   3.58 |   3.91 |   4.48 | ▂▅▇▇▃ |\r\n| wt            |         0 |             1 |   3.28 |   0.97 |   0.76 |   2.73 |   3.27 |   4.00 |   5.28 | ▁▃▇▆▃ |\r\n| qsec          |         0 |             1 |  17.77 |   1.58 |  15.02 |  16.65 |  17.55 |  18.97 |  21.52 | ▃▇▅▃▂ |\r\n| vs            |         0 |             1 |   0.44 |   0.54 |  -0.49 |   0.07 |   0.39 |   0.90 |   1.61 | ▅▇▇▆▂ |\r\n| am            |         0 |             1 |   0.36 |   0.41 |  -0.76 |   0.20 |   0.38 |   0.62 |   1.09 | ▁▂▇▆▅ |\r\n| gear          |         0 |             1 |   3.69 |   0.66 |   2.13 |   3.24 |   3.73 |   4.08 |   4.99 | ▁▅▇▅▃ |\r\n| carb          |         0 |             1 |   3.06 |   1.57 |  -0.34 |   1.81 |   2.79 |   4.06 |   6.35 | ▂▅▇▆▃ |\r\n\r\n\u003csup\u003eCreated on 2022-07-07 by the [reprex package](https://reprex.tidyverse.org) (v2.0.1)\u003c/sup\u003e\r\n\r\nOnce we merge this into main, we should be able to access it like:\r\n\r\n```r\r\nread_csv(\"https://vetiver.rstudio.com/get-started/new-cars.csv\")\r\n```","published_at":"2022-07-08T00:51:20Z","updated_at":"2022-07-08T16:54:30Z","url":"https://github.com/rstudio/vetiver.posit.co/pull/27","type":"pr","extra":{"author":"juliasilge","merged_at":"2022-07-08T16:54:30Z","state":"MERGED"}}
